    "notes": [
      "Signatures below match PUBLICLY KNOWN executor product names and generic loader patterns.",
      "The 'hashes' map ships EMPTY on purpose. A hash list is only useful if every entry was",
      "verified against a real sample; inventing or copying unverified hashes produces false",
      "positives that quarantine innocent files. Add your own with 'execguard submit', or point",
      "updates.threat_feed_url at a community feed you trust.",
      "The 'endpoints' map ships empty for the same reason: blocking an IP you have not verified",
      "can cut off unrelated services that share the host."
    ]
